<title>GERMANY: German Jan producer prices rise 0.3 pct m/m.</title>
<headline>German Jan producer prices rise 0.3 pct m/m.</headline>
<dateline>WIESBADEN, Germany 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Federal Statistics</p>
<p>Office reported the following economic indicator:</p>
<p>PAN GERMAN PRODUCER PRICES    Jan 97	Dec 96	 Jan 96</p>
<p> Monthly figure		    +0.3	  unch	   -0.7</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr			    +0.7	  -0.3	   unch</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	  104.1	 103.8	  103.4</p>
<p>WEST GERMAN PRODUCER PRICES</p>
<p> Monthly figure		    +0.4	  unch	   -0.7</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr			    +0.6	  -0.5	   unch</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	  103.7	 103.3	  103.1</p>
<p>EAST GERMAN PRODUCER PRICES</p>
<p> Monthly figure		    +0.5	  unch	   unch</p>
<p> Yr-on-yr			    +1.8	  +1.4	   +1.8</p>
<p> Index (base 100 1991)	  109.8	 109.3	  107.9</p>
<p>-- Bonn newsroom, 49-228-26097150</p>
